"Foreign residents hold an Alien Resident Certificate (ARC) number instead"
" of a national ID. Many websites reject it. This site scores %(count)s "
"services on how they treat ARC holders, and gives developers the code to "
"fix theirs."
msgstr ""
"外籍居民持有的是居留證（ARC）上的外來人口統一證號，而非身分證字號，但許多網站不接受。本站針對 %(count)s "
"個服務評比其對居留證持有人的待遇，並提供開發者修正驗證程式的程式碼。"

